  heroValueProp: 'The International School Ho Chi Minh City (ISHCMC) / British International School (BIS HCMC + Hanoi) / United Nations International School Hanoi (UNIS Hanoi) / Saigon South International School (SSIS) / Concordia Hanoi / American International School / Renaissance Saigon (RISS) alternative at USD 180/month. Built for Vietnamese elite families targeting US Ivy League, UK Russell Group, Canadian U15 and Australian Group of Eight; Vingroup ecosystem executive families; Saigon Hi-Tech Park multinational executives (Intel Vietnam, Samsung Electro-Mechanics); Samsung Vietnam Korean expat manufacturing community in Bac Ninh (~30,000-50,000 Korean residents supporting the SEV complex producing ~50% of Samsung\'s global smartphones); Binh Duong manufacturing executive families (Korean Lotte/Doosan, Japanese Bridgestone/Honda, Taiwanese Foxconn, Singaporean Sembcorp, American P&G); plus Vung Tau international oil & gas industry families (PetroVietnam, Vietsovpetro, Premier Oil, Murphy Oil, Schlumberger). ICT afternoon and evening live classes (1 PM – 8 PM Vietnam time) match Vietnamese post-school and học thêm hours.',
