  competitorsIntro: 'Vietnam has a rapidly-developing international school sector concentrated in Ho Chi Minh City and Hanoi, with growing presence in Da Nang, Bac Ninh, Binh Duong and the broader regional network. Vietnamese families also invest in học thêm (extra tuition) — Vietnamese supplementary academic instruction, less formalised than Korean hagwon or Japanese juku but a significant educational pattern. Below are the major international schools Vietnamese families compare with Smartious. Fees reflect 2026 USD-equivalent ranges.',
